{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat Train TD is a tower defense roguelike strategy game centered around combat trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will embark on a tower defense adventure in a virtual fantasy world. You need to choose a suitable base, carefully plan the track routes, and deploy combat train formations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When the combat trains hit station nodes, they can eliminate the incoming monsters. During the game, continuously unlock new metros, bases, and treasures to create unique build styles and defend your base until the very end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/97c17a0885d3e2098e1aa32135ee6f92.poster.webp?t=1756092660\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/97c17a0885d3e2098e1aa32135ee6f92.webp?t=1756092660\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adjust Tracks &amp; Auto-Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply stations for ammunition will randomly appear on the battlefield. When the combat train run on the tracks and reach these stations, they will replenish ammunition and fire shells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/8c97e63d6a97bb286f71fd3083922aca.avif?t=1756092660\" width=2048 height=1152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Train Formations &amp; Defend the Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, more combat train and bases will be unlocked. Continuously upgrade and strengthen the train groups, and you'll be able to defeat stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/bfebb6d6bdee442eac59717149ad7618.avif?t=1756092660\" width=2048 height=1152 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841840?t=1756092660","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841840?t=1756092660","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/a8a4ef28833e04c93db9d2c11a0868dc09c92fe0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756092660","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/a8a4ef28833e04c93db9d2c11a0868dc09c92fe0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756092660","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat Train TD is a tower defense roguelike strategy game centered around combat trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will embark on a tower defense adventure in a virtual fantasy world. You need to choose a suitable base, carefully plan the track routes, and deploy combat train formations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When the combat trains hit station nodes, they can eliminate the incoming monsters. During the game, continuously unlock new metros, bases, and treasures to create unique build styles and defend your base until the very end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/97c17a0885d3e2098e1aa32135ee6f92.poster.webp?t=1756092660\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/97c17a0885d3e2098e1aa